    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>O.S.A. \u201cOperation Stuffed Animals\u201d A grotesquely ingenious co-op adventure in a frenzy of madness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a fluffy, slightly crazy creature with questionable life choices and only one goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambush dealers, steal their \u201cQuirky goods\u201d and drag them to your getaway car with your quirky super hand. Whether it's Hashy, Cannabbi or Cokki, the more you steal, the more dollars you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone or in co-op with friends, you rummage through abandoned laboratories and crammed dealer hideouts while being constantly hunted by mutated enemies that look like the worst children's birthday party ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fight with absurd weapons, transform into obscure objects and when it gets too much? Then you just stop for a moment and take a selfie in the middle of the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because you can. And because madness also needs good angles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705780/extras/d297450cdf4bc56c4e647e7f758e9e78.poster.avif?t=1754240196\" width=800 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705780/extras/d297450cdf4bc56c4e647e7f758e9e78.webm?t=1754240196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705780/extras/d297450cdf4bc56c4e647e7f758e9e78.mp4?t=1754240196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>O.S.A. is a wild mix of black humor, co-op action, physics-based chaos and a dash of (illegal) fantasy chemistry.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No morals, no rules just you, your stuff, and the path to the next drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the fluffy madness.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>O.S.A. \u201cOperation Stuffed Animals\u201d A grotesquely ingenious co-op adventure in a frenzy of madness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a fluffy, slightly crazy creature with questionable life choices and only one goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambush dealers, steal their \u201cQuirky goods\u201d and drag them to your getaway car with your quirky super hand. Whether it's Hashy, Cannabbi or Cokki, the more you steal, the more dollars you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone or in co-op with friends, you rummage through abandoned laboratories and crammed dealer hideouts while being constantly hunted by mutated enemies that look like the worst children's birthday party ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fight with absurd weapons, transform into obscure objects and when it gets too much? Then you just stop for a moment and take a selfie in the middle of the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because you can. And because madness also needs good angles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705780/extras/d297450cdf4bc56c4e647e7f758e9e78.poster.avif?t=1754240196\" width=800 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705780/extras/d297450cdf4bc56c4e647e7f758e9e78.webm?t=1754240196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705780/extras/d297450cdf4bc56c4e647e7f758e9e78.mp4?t=1754240196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>O.S.A. is a wild mix of black humor, co-op action, physics-based chaos and a dash of (illegal) fantasy chemistry.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No morals, no rules just you, your stuff, and the path to the next drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the fluffy madness.</p>",
    "short_description": "In O.S.A. \u201cOperation Stuffed Animals\u201d you are a crazy, fluffy creature on a crazy co-op adventure. Ambush dealers, steal \u201cbizarre goods\u201d and fight mutated enemies. Chaos, absurd weapons and quirky humor await you!",
